  "description": "Non-material amendment of planning permission 20/AP/1383 dated 16/04/2021 Redevelopment of the Former Cherry Garden School to provide 56 dwellings together with car and cycle parking, hard and soft landscaping and other associated works' for the following changes:\rBlank panels replaced with dark recessed bricks inline with Fire Safety requirements\rCore A mailboxes relocated inside a secure entrance lobby  \rDouble doors have been updated so that the leading leaf is wider to allow 850mm clear opening to comply with building regulations \rCommunal entrance canopies have been updated with an extra vertical side down to the ground\rLow height wall below railings omitted - full height railings proposed\rL05 privacy screen added",
